{"last_link_id": 17, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["【产品专用抠图工作流 · RunningHub 适配版 v5】\n\n用法：左上传产品图 → 点运行 → 得三张图：透明底 PNG / 白底图 / 遮罩预览。\n\n■ 主模型 BiRefNet-matting（1024，MIT 可商用）\n  通用 matting 训练版，产品图边缘稳。\n  注：更新的 Lucida（透明/玻璃材质更强，2026-07 发布）\n  RunningHub 插件版本还没更新到，等下拉列表出现 Lucida 可切换。\n■ 边缘调整口诀\n  有白边 → mask_offset 调 -1 ~ -2\n  缺肉/边缘被吃 → mask_offset 调 +1 ~ +2\n  边缘毛糙 → mask_blur 1 → 2\n  小物体漏检 → 换 BiRefNet-general 或启用下方备用组\n■ 大图（长边 >2000px）要更细边缘\n  模型下拉切到 BiRefNet-HR-matting（2048 处理，更吃显存）。\n■ 超分（可选，画布左下）\n  「选原图还是超分」节点的 cond 勾选框：\n  不勾（默认）→ 原图直接抠，快；\n  勾上 → 先 SeedVR2 扩散超分（修复质感+提清晰度）再抠。\n  三个超分节点参数均为平台默认（3B fp8 模型，开箱即用）；\n  要更高清：把主节点 resolution 调到 2048+（更慢）；\n  要更锐：DiT 加载节点模型下拉换 7b_sharp（更吃显存）；\n  显存不够：DiT 加载节点 blocks_to_swap 调 10~16。\n  首次运行自动下载模型（约 3.5GB），耐心等。\n■ 镂空/网状产品（篮子、滤网、编织）\n  主模型可能糊成一片 → 右键取消静音右侧【备用组 InSPyReNet】再跑。\n■ 输出说明\n  ComfyUI 原生保存只有 PNG；白底 PNG 可直接当电商主图，\n  要 JPG 可在导出后随手转，或后续加保存节点。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [560, 340], "pos": [-60, -400], "id": 0, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Note"}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "slot_index": 0, "links": [7], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "slot_index": 1, "links": [14], "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}, {"name": "MASK_IMAGE", "slot_index": 2, "links": [8], "label": "MASK_IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "MASK_IMAGE"}], "color": "#222e40", "widgets_values": ["BiRefNet-matting", 1, 0, false, true, "Alpha", "#222222"], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 6, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "mask_blur"}, "shape": 7, "name": "mask_blur", "label": "mask_blur", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "mask_blur"}, {"widget": {"name": "mask_offset"}, "shap